    until \code{chol} succeeds. With \eqn{S_{\mathrm{inv}} =
    \mathrm{chol2inv}(\mathrm{chol}(S+\lambda I))} the head is
    \eqn{w = S_{\mathrm{inv}}(\mu_1-\mu_0)},
    \eqn{b = -\tfrac12(\mu_1+\mu_0)^\top w}.
